      "guid": "com.maschine.defaultautofiremode",
      "name": "DefaultAutoFireMode",
      "slug": "defaultautofiremode",
      "teaser": "Automatically switches weapons to full-auto whenever you draw them into your hands.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/HQZjQsOUomS09mqIsxdhzJzUKFjfFPc8jmv3CbhO.png",
      "downloads": 1614,
      "favourites_count": 7,
      "description": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Default Fire Mode Fixer by acidphantasm</a> but using a different approach.<br />\nIt switches weapons to full-auto whenever you draw them into your Hands, basically double-tapping B but without the animation.<br />\nThis has the benefit that it works with <strong>ALL</strong> weapons, whether bought or looted, vanilla and modded alike.<br />\nIf you switch to semi-automatic and change weapons, it will revert to auto the next time you draw.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT folder</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let me know if you run into any problems or have suggestions for improvement.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2740/defaultautofiremode",
